      "writtenOn": "2018-04-19T06:30:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nothing in android should be requiring sudo access -- if you want to do something special, you should probably be ingesting a target-files package, then regenerating the image with releasetools, not mounting it.\n\nOr modifying it on the device (though I imagine you might need to wipe some state in data and/or reboot to make things appear as preinstalled)",
